90:| P-10a | Classify → Notify | Classifier and notification for different admitted calls |
91:| P-10b | Notify → Classify | Classifier and notification for different admitted calls |
118:| P-24a | Report → Notify | Competing reports and a transition notification |
119:| P-24b | Notify → Report | Competing reports and a transition notification |
120:| P-25a | RequestReturn → Notify | An in-flight request returns during notification |
121:| P-25b | Notify → RequestReturn | An in-flight request returns during notification |
122:| P-26a | Classify → TripPolicy | Classification and trip policy for different requests |
123:| P-26b | TripPolicy → Classify | Classification and trip policy for different requests |
124:| P-27a | RequestReturn → TripPolicy | In-flight work returns during failure policy |
125:| P-27b | TripPolicy → RequestReturn | In-flight work returns during failure policy |
126:| P-28a | Report → TripPolicy | Another report competes with a trip policy |
127:| P-28b | TripPolicy → Report | Another report competes with a trip policy |
